WEBVTT

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.960
A great disaster cometh.

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:10.960
Do not approach it, for it is the embodiment of ruin.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:15.290
Do not touch it, for it is the oracle of death.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.170
The squirrel shall bloom flowers of gore.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:22.290
The hammer shall shatter to pieces.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.170
The foreign warriors shall be broken
down to mere playthings.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:31.790
Though the blood-soaked harlot
absconds with a keepsake of the fox,

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.880
a hoard of ravaging teeth and
claws shall send her the way of all flesh.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.420
The companion shall bequeath sorrow.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.790
Take heed.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.080
It is a banquet of tragedy.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.540
I don't want anyone to die.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.750
It should be okay.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:16.250
None of the horrors that I saw will come to pass
as long as we avoid going down to the 27th floor.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:20.290
"Into severe plight"...

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.380
I just wish I knew what fate had in store for him.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:43.210
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.460
<b>Mirabilis</b>

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.460
<b>Chaos</b>

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.670
We've got Mermen!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.710
Mr. Bors!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.710
Right!

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.710
Take out their leader!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.210
It's the one with darker colors!

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:20.880
Okay!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.670
More trouble incoming!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.040
Light Quartz!

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.500
Get ready to rush 'em when they run out
of lasers and start charging up.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.830
Hold on. What the hell, Rabbit's Foot?!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.630
This scarf is incredible. Not only is it good protection,
but it can also be used as a weapon.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.670
It's super sturdy from what I can tell,
which means I might be able to do even more with it.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:10.420
Hey, man. Is this really your first time on the 27th floor?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.210
U-uh, yeah, it is.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.290
Well, you're really kicking ass.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.580
With strength like that, I'm convinced there's
no problem letting you lead the vanguard.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.960
Oh, well, thank you.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.960
That means I'm putting you in charge
of all the annoying stuff.

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:27.920
Oh. But we're still splitting the rare drops evenly, okay?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.670
Oh boy... I get the feeling he using me like an assistant.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.080
You're turned into a real powerhouse, Bell Cranel!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:35.920
Huh?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.460
Remember us?

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.330
We've met once before. We were part of the group
who charged at the Goliath with you.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.380
You mean we fought together?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.830
We're banking on you to help carry
the party, Rabbit's Foot!

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.250
Oh! Thanks!

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:49.830
I'll do my best!

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.250
The Gale Wind is proving pretty damn hard to find.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:01.210
I'm just itching to take her down!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.790
As if you stand any chance.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:08.710
We're talking about a veritable freak of nature
who managed to wipe out an entire Familia on her own.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:11.670
Sure, but she had a good reason for doing that, right?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:12.920
More or less.

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:17.920
She was getting revenge against the murderers who set
a trap that killed nearly every member of her old Familia.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.380
And the Familia she wiped out were part of Evilus,
so you know they were a bunch of twisted bastards.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.130
It's not hard to see why she did it.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:28.630
Yeah, but she literally eradicated that Familia by taking
out everyone associated with them.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.040
Even if those connections were iffy.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.460
No sane person would do that.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:36.540
Aw, don't get your panties in a bunch!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.750
Even if she's as superhuman as they say,

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.080
we've got enough manpower down here
on the 27th floor to beat her for sure.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:47.460
You're level 4, right? You gotta be
more confident than us at least!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.460
It's time to get moving, ya bums!

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.080
We're splitting up the party yet again!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.960
Rabbit's Foot! You're with me, get over here!

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:56.460
Uh, yessir!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.000
If you find Gale Wind,
then drive her into the big hollow cavern!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.960
Move out!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.210
Roger!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.630
I have to hurry and find Ms. Ryu
before anyone else does.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:21.170
I think my best option is to wait for
a chance to ditch the party.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.580
Bors! Check this out!

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.130
What the flying hell?

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:38.130
I've never seen such a huge hole on this floor before...

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.290
It's almost like something dug it to go through here.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:46.290
Looks like the dungeon hasn't started repairing it yet.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:50.750
Hold up. Does that mean whatever
caused it is still nearby?

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.960
It wasn't the Gale Wind, right?

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.670
I don't think using magic would've been
enough to cause something like this.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.670
What's our next move, Bors?

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.580
Normally, I'd say we hightail it outta here.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.210
But I can't pass up a shot at 80 million valis.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.040
Hey! Do you hear that?!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.000
Singing?

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.330
I'm gonna go check it out!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.630
Hey! Wait!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.130
He'll catch on eventually
if you keep staring at him like that.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.580
I did a little asking around and...

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:41.670
most people seem to remember this "Turk" guy
first settling down in Rivira about 3 years ago.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:43.460
What's his rank?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.790
Level 2.

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:50.580
He's apparently come down to this floor multiple times
by tagging along with second-class adventurers.

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:54.790
So I guess being a resident of Rivira has earned him
a basic degree of trust from people.

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.630
But considering what Bell said...

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.920
I think Ms. Cassandra has a point.
Can you please stay here on the 25th floor?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.420
There's actually something I'd like you to do.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.920
Can you please keep a close
watch on that Werewolf guy?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.080
You know, just in case he does anything suspicious.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.420
Nothing suspicious yet, though.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:22.500
Do we really think that this guy is up to no good?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.540
Let's just attack him.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.380
Have you lost your mind?!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.580
We're wasting time right now.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.290
Being violent will get us answers.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.170
It's the quickest and most effective method.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.290
Yike. I can't get behind the Amazoness mentality...

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:39.290
Doing that would instantly make
everyone hostile towards us.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.670
I'm not sure it's the wisest move...

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.830
Then we'll be more covert.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.210
All right. You guys go act as lookouts.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.040
Wh-what exactly are you planning to do?

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:50.630
Do you even have to ask?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:54.250
I'm gonna drag him into a cave
somewhere and then shag it outta him.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.040
Wah! Wah! Wah!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.420
Absolutely not!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.000
Tsk.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.500
C'mon! Let's get moving!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.920
We can't just let Bors and the others handle everything!

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.580
Nobody is sure that the Gale Wind
is actually on the 27th floor.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.170
So let's search this floor for her!

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.710
Bors made it clear that our job
is to stay here and keep watch.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:18.540
I want to get revenge for Jean by killing
that bitch with my own two hands, man!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:22.290
I get why you're so eager, but we'd only
be getting into a fight that we can't win.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:27.540
Some adventurer you are! Don't any of you want to make
a name for yourselves by taking down a big bounty?!

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.670
Well, I'm going with Turk!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.920
You gotta be stupid to think sitting
around like this is a good idea!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.420
Well, the last thing we want is to get chewed out
by Bors later. Go and do whatever you want!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.830
Fine. Wait here like a damn baby.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:42.170
Let's go.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.500
What're you spacing out for?

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.380
Sorry about that.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.210
Marie!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.250
Bell!

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.000
What were you thinking?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.670
You know it's dangerous to sing
when there's other people down here.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:16.750
Marie?

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:20.790
Just calm down, Marie. Tell me what happened.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.750
There's... something down here that shouldn't be...

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:28.960
What do you mean?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.790
What shouldn't be here?

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:33.920
I'm not sure.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.830
I dunno when it came here or where it went.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.420
I have no idea.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:42.250
It's something unknown to me...

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:51.130
So whatever made that hole...
must be hiding somewhere on this floor.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.830
Hey Marie? Have you seen an elf woman around?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.250
Elf?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.670
Uh... someone with ears longer than mine.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:04.580
She has a wooden sword. And wears a hood.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:06.080
And also...

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.580
Does that sound familiar?

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:11.250
Where did you see her? Please tell me, Marie!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:13.580
But...

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.210
I have to find her, no matter what!

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.210
Over there.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:06.750
Ms. Ryu...?

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.920
WHY ARE YOU HERE?!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.330
What reason... could you have to be here?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.580
Ms. Ryu... I...

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:29.420
Mr. Cranel. You need to leave this floor.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.210
Right now.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.500
C-can you tell me what's goin-?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.670
JUST BE QUIET AND DO WHAT I TELL YOU!

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.210
You're better off not knowing.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.330
So stay out of this.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.460
Out of what? What are you doing?!

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.250
Who is that man?!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:57.420
Scum like him... deserve to become monster food.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.380
W-why would she do this...?

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.420
You just gonna keep following us forever?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.830
It makes more sense to move as a group
if we're trying to hunt Gale Wind, right?

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.170
I mean, think about it. Taking down a level 4
with a bounty on her head isn't an easy feat.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:35.130
Our presence clearly has them on their toes.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.000
He seems really frustrated about it.
Makes you wonder why.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:46.040
I'm starting to think... I should have told Mr. Bell about
the details of my dream.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:51.540
But "the fairy who is sworn to be an usher of doom"...

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.710
That makes it sound like Gale Wind
is responsible for everything.

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.790
If the murder of that man in Rivira and

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:01.880
the impending disaster are really something
caused by her hands, then...

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.790
I'm putting my faith in Ms. Ryu.

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.880
That means... he's going to be
betrayed by someone he trusts.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.540
Bell?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:19.290
Bell!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.790
Was it Ms. Ryu who maimed this guy...?

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.670
No, it couldn't be!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:41.380
Anyways, in my opinion, all the sharp cuts
that were on the guy's arms and legs

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:44.170
were very likely done by the Gale Wind.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.460
But why...?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:53.000
Bell!

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:55.750
Bell!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.210
Don't follow me!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.130
Bell!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.420
I'm sorry!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.250
You jerk!

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.540
Whoa, what happened here?!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.630
Somebody trashed the absolute shit outta this place.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.830
But what the hell does this kind of damage?

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:24.880
None of these people were part of
the group that came down with us.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:26.750
Found another dead body!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.380
Same here!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:34.000
Was this also Ms. Ryu's doing...?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.710
Hey Rabbit's Foot!

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:38.750
Where the hell have you been?!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.540
S-sorry about that! I went off on my own!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:48.540
Dammit, I've got no idea what's going on. But one thing
we know for sure is that a monster didn't cause this.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.630
Huh? Hey.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.790
What's the deal with the dwarf?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.630
W-well, he was...

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:57.500
Don't tell me, another victim of Gale Wind?!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:02.880
Shit!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:05.250
Aren't there any survivors that
can tell us what happened?!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:08.130
Bors! I found one! This guy's still breathing!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.170
Hey! Can you talk to us?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.130
What happened here?!

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.290
G-G-Gale Wind...!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.000
It was that bitch, Lion!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.380
Did you say Gale Wind?!

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:36.460
She fired off this magic and something shined bright,
then my vision went totally white...

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:39.460
Hurry and tell us where she went!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.630
Hold on, Bors.

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.250
Let me treat him fir-

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:43.670
DON'T TOUCH ME!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.040
Don't touch me... Please don't touch me...!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.580
All right. Just relax, I won't touch you.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:55.250
Look at how badly he's traumatized...

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.210
Damn that Gale Wind. She's one sick piece of work.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:00.500
But was it really her?

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:06.040
Wait. I recognize you. Aren't you Jura Halmar?

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:09.210
Y-you know this guy, Mr. Bors?!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.250
Sure do. He's a wanted man.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.830
He belongs to the Rudra Familia,
which is a part of Evilus.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.630
The same faction that trapped and killed everyone in the
Astraea Familia, which Gale Wind once belonged to.

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.460
So he's one of the people Gale Wind wants revenge on?

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.460
I thought all of them were long dead.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.790
But somehow this bastard's still breathing.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.790
Y-yeah, that's right!

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.630
I was the only survivor!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:35.960
But I've been on the straight and narrow ever since then!

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:38.080
I was in hiding the whole time!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.830
But... then Lion found me somehow!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:46.540
So, the reason Jean got killed back in Rivira
was because he had some connection to this guy?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.670
Is that right?

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.040
It seems pretty damn likely.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.460
Help me out! I don't wanna die!

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:56.630
I'm a good guy now! You gotta protect me from her!

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:01.500
Wh-what do you think, Bors?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:10.000
Don't forget what we came here for.
We came to collect the bounty on that elf's head!

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:12.670
This changes absolutely nothing.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:19.420
If anything, it means we can get even more money
by handing his sorry ass over to the guild.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:20.540
Yeah!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.040
What is this...?

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.040
It's her! Gale Wind!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.790
Wipe the floor with her, boys!

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.790
Stand aside!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.130
JURA!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.420
Aim for the legs!

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:08.630
Once we kill her momentum, we can all pile on
and beat the tar out of her!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.500
Don't get cocky, you little shit!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:31.000
Hold on a minute! Were you part of that fight?!

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.420
Stop! Please just wait!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:45.880
You're in my way.

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:54.380
Sh-shit! Go after her, Rabbit's Foot!

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:04.040
Ms. Ryu is the murderer?!
I really don't want to believe that!

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:08.170
But... if that Jura guy really did help kill her old Familia...

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.210
I wiped out that enemy Familia.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:17.460
To avenge my companions,
no method was too low for me...

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.790
as I was driven by my fury.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.000
Was that Ms. Ryu's magic?!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.460
B-Bell Cranel!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.330
It's you!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:46.920
Please! You gotta save me!

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:49.420
She's gonna kill me for sure!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:00.330
Ms. Ryu...

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:09.670
Why are you always getting involved?

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.670
Go somewhere else. You're in the way.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:20.000
I can't slay that fiend with you standing there.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:26.670
The only real mistake I ever made...

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:30.290
was not making absolutely sure
that you were dead, Jura.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:33.040
My arrogance got the better of me,

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:37.460
I assumed I had killed you and it fills me
with so much regret that I will never live down.

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:46.540
I should have completely snuffed out
your life when I had the chance.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.330
Wait, Ms. Ryu...

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:58.580
I won't hesitate to cut you down if you try and stop me.

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:39.920
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:39.920
<b>Lambton</b>

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:39.920
<b>Ill Omen</b>

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:38.630
Next time: "Lambton."
